g other people's wishes, after imitating the \"Star Origin Stone\" that can fulfill all wishes. However，she is a failure due to limitations that wishes must be granted in a contract with certain conditions. Because of this, she takes commitment extremely seriously, has a peaceful personality, and is all-encompassing. She has serious self-sacrifice and puts herself at the bottom, but the force value is very high.Due to inhuman treatment, she escaped from the experimental base and is currently traveling across the continent.\n\npoint:\nShe fights with various magic arrays and two chains with daggers on the tips.\nThe red pattern on her face will change with the current covenant, and it will be a cross when there is no covenant.(You can design it freely and it doesn't matter if you don't~)\n\nsymbolic element：cross, chain, chocker, thorns, star etc.\n\nThese elements do not need to be used in all, they are for reference only!You also can add anything you see fit!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1_EPUpZmGob66nn2jUq8N5LVUxx_Zvjv6", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@416_wakaba/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6fe5094d/uploads/origins/0bc7eded-4512-404b-8f9b-8f682c5acf88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1088343aebb04e2bd1c0baa350de2b04", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6fe5094d/uploads/origins/0bc7eded-4512-404b-8f9b-8f682c5acf88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1088343aebb04e2bd1c0baa350de2b04, https://si.imgix.net/6fe5094d/uploads/origins/0bc7eded-4512-404b-8f9b-8f682c5acf88?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=998ea1f78a79d9